    "headline": "EatMe – Independent Pop between momentum and nostalgia",
    "paragraphs": [
      "EatMe creates independent pop/rock with influences from shoegaze, hyperpop, and folk.",
      "Guitars, electronic elements, and pop melodies come together—sometimes calm than loud, at times direct other times dreamy."
    ]
  },
