  "section-04-text-02": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "The songs revolve around in-between states, growth, and everything that defines your twenties: self-doubt, transitions, friendships, love, and the attempt to keep going after setbacks.",
      "It's about moments when you lose yourself and find your way back again."
    ]
